[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000600_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000600_02_0010","text":"对了，那位导演要结婚了是吧\n那我们应该送份贺礼呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000600_02_0020","text":"好的！我也想送祝福！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000600_02_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000600_02_0030","text":"……不过这种场合，\n该送什么好呢—"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000600_02_0040","text":"只要能把……\n感谢的心情……传达出去……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000600_02_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000600_02_0050","text":"感谢的心情……那果然还是\n用话语来表达最好吧！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000600_02_0060","text":"话语的礼物……呵呵，好浪漫呀！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000600_02_0070","text":"视频信怎么样！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000600_02_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000600_02_0075","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000600_02_0080","text":"说得对！能看到大家的脸\n又能用话语传达心意！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000600_02_0090","text":"智代子小姐……\n真是好主意……呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000600_02_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000600_02_0100","text":"呵呵，过奖了！"}]
